From u7e208d26917e9ea2 at groups.google.com  Tue Dec  9 18:00:02 2014
From: u7e208d26917e9ea2 at groups.google.com (Emily Zefferman)
Date: Tue, 09 Dec 2014 18:00:02 +0000
Subject: Re: [D-RUG]: blocked split-plot ANOVA with fixed and random effects
Message-ID: <dHzI8w4N_zQ.1fAlX6zfTJUJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com>
