Hey everyone,

I am building a semi-discrete model and need to access time t-1 in my ode model. I have tried using a counter and an outside vector, but the variable at t-1 is always NA or 0. Has anyone else run into this problem, or been able to access previous values in a differential equation model? Thanks for the help!

Best,
Alison

